description.p:
Solids, local axes and Mac. The Solid Tools (Outer
        Shell, Union, Subtract, Trim, Intersect, Split) and Intersect
        Faces; local axes for groups and components, with Change Axes and
        .skp files that keep them; the Rotated Rectangle's protractors;
        Explode one level at a time; a light theme, or the desktop's;
        and a first packaged build for macOS.
